        <mxCell id="OcTj5MCsbyI-WAYkrYNF-3" parent="OcTj5MCsbyI-WAYkrYNF-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" value="Baby_Coil origin is polymorphic (FR-08): exactly one of Laporan_Unpacking_Coil_Id / Stok_Gudang_WIP_Id / Gudang_Material_Hold_Id is populated per row. Stok_Gudang_WIP and Gudang_Material_Hold follow the stock-ledger (kartu stock) convention. Staff.Role and Costbook_Material.Gudang_Asal are closed 4-/3-value sets (Operator/PPIC/Admin Produksi/Accounting; Gudang Produksi 2/Gudang WIP/Gudang Material Hold) modeled as plain string columns pending a project enum-vs-string convention. Product Costing stays undrawn -- confirmed out-of-scope/external dependency per fr-nfr.md&#39;s Re-Confirm section. Report Produksi is laid out as a single row so every cross-entity relationship can route through the open corridor above it without crossing an unrelated table." vertex="1">
